# PromoMerch environment notes
#
# DB and BUCKET are Cloudflare platform bindings requested in
# .openai/hosting.json as d1: "DB" and r2: "BUCKET".
# Sites provisions and connects their hosted resources.
# They are not environment-variable connection strings.
# Local preview storage is separate from hosted customer data.
#
# Email notifications are not configured.
# No SMTP host, sender credentials, mail API key or delivery queue is
# consumed by the current quote implementation.
# Add a supported provider and durable notification workflow before
# configuring its required server-side secrets in the hosting platform.
#
# This example intentionally contains comments only.
# Never commit real credentials, customer records or uploaded artwork.
# See docs/OPERATIONS.md and docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.

